From: EglantinePS5 <noreply@eglantineps5.local>
Subject: [PATCH] EDEN_UP_SHADOW_ROWS=1: register shadow forms for seven more opcodes and SHF uniform

Upstream: Frizti/Fritchii 60377e0804 (cherry-pick of 0c757afb53) and 5885850c68 (cherry-pick of
87ac53a290), both by ale. Lowering every program in Ocarina's shader archives rejected 15 mesh and
vertex programs, and two mesh programs on SHF.L.W.U32 R200, R200, UR6, RZ, because
PrepareRegisterPressure had no operand list for the opcode.

Rows (lower_to_maxwell.h PrepareRegisterPressure, same operand sets as upstream
register_pressure.h): 0x3c2 R2UR Ra(24) only, bits 16-23 name the uniform register; 0x803 P2R
Rd(16), Ra(24); 0x809 FMNMX immediate Rd, Ra; 0xc20 FMUL uniform Rd, Ra; 0xc23 FFMA uniform Rd, Ra,
Rc(64); 0xc45 I2FP uniform Rd; 0xb82 LDC indexed Rd (a pair when Bits(73,3) == 5), Ra; 0xc19 SHF
uniform Rd, low(24), high(64). The lowering of these opcodes is unchanged.

Already here: IMAD 0xc24 (Fritchii dfac3c45, Lichii #279 by Hazmad: the two Kakariko graveyard
pixel programs) is in 0465 behind EDEN_UP_FRITCHII_SHADOWMORE (lower_to_maxwell.h:116). This
patch does not touch the graveyard programs: they need SHADOWMORE=1.

Unset: the new cases return valid = false exactly like the default case, so lowering is
byte-identical. Set, only programs that were rejected before change (the rows are reached only
where the default case rejected the program). The switch is in TranslationSwitches
(vk_pipeline_prep.cpp, like SHADOWMORE): an arm with it set gets its own prep store and the shader
set is converted once more with it; arms without it keep their stores.

Rejection line in our tree: "Native shader at ..., instruction ...: native program uses lowering
scratch registers [op c19 ...]" (shader_environment.cpp:701), not upstream's "native register
shadowing mode". Catch2 tests not ported (no test tree here).

v2 of the draft: adds the switch to TranslationSwitches and fixes the comments.

diff --git a/src/shader_recompiler/frontend/ampere/lower_to_maxwell.h b/src/shader_recompiler/frontend/ampere/lower_to_maxwell.h
index 57951d0..c86fd03 100644
--- a/src/shader_recompiler/frontend/ampere/lower_to_maxwell.h
+++ b/src/shader_recompiler/frontend/ampere/lower_to_maxwell.h
@@ -78,6 +78,23 @@ inline RegisterPressure PrepareRegisterPressure(const Instruction& input, u32 re
     const auto operand = [&](u32 bit, u32 count = 1) { operands.push_back({bit, count}); };
     const u32 opcode = input.Bits(0, 12);
     switch (opcode) {
+    // EDEN_UP_SHADOW_ROWS=1 (Frizti/Fritchii 60377e0804 and 5885850c68, ale): R2UR, P2R, FMNMX
+    // immediate, FMUL/FFMA/I2FP with a uniform source, LDC indexed, SHF with a uniform amount.
+    // Unset: no shadow form, as before (the program is rejected and its draws skipped). Set, it
+    // changes converted shaders (in TranslationSwitches): the shader set is converted once more.
+    case 0x3c2: case 0x803: case 0x809: case 0xc20:
+    case 0xc23: case 0xc45: case 0xb82: case 0xc19: {
+        static const bool enabled = Common::PeSwitch("EDEN_UP_SHADOW_ROWS");
+        if (!enabled) { result.valid = false; return result; }
+        switch (opcode) {
+        case 0x3c2: operand(24); break;
+        case 0x803: case 0x809: case 0xc20: operand(16); operand(24); break;
+        case 0xc23: case 0xc19: operand(16); operand(24); operand(64); break;
+        case 0xc45: operand(16); break;
+        case 0xb82: operand(16, input.Bits(73, 3) == 5 ? 2 : 1); operand(24); break;
+        }
+        break;
+    }
     case 0x802: case 0xa02: case 0xb08: case 0xd08: operand(16); break;
     case 0x804: case 0x80c: operand(24); break;
     case 0x805: operand(16, 2); break;
diff --git a/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_pipeline_prep.cpp b/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_pipeline_prep.cpp
index e91d6fb..20db041 100644
--- a/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_pipeline_prep.cpp
+++ b/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_pipeline_prep.cpp
@@ -147,7 +147,8 @@ constexpr const char* TranslationSwitches[] = {
     "EDEN_UP_NULL_POINTER_SLOTS", "EDEN_UP_OOT_FRONT_WAIT", "EDEN_UP_OOT_FSR_SHARPNESS",
     "EDEN_UP_OOT_FSR_SPATIAL", "EDEN_UP_OOT_MIST_DEPTH", "EDEN_UP_OOT_MIST_DEPTH_ULPS",
     "EDEN_UP_OOT_MOVIE_COPY", "EDEN_UP_QUERY_LIGHT", "EDEN_UP_QUERY_STATS",
-    "EDEN_UP_SHADOW_REGISTERS", "EDEN_UP_SPLIT_FIRST_DRAIN", "EDEN_UP_STAGE_CACHE",
+    "EDEN_UP_SHADOW_REGISTERS", "EDEN_UP_SHADOW_ROWS", "EDEN_UP_SPLIT_FIRST_DRAIN",
+    "EDEN_UP_STAGE_CACHE",
     "EDEN_UP_STAGE_CACHE_MIB", "EDEN_UP_STAGE_CACHE_VERIFY", "EDEN_UP_STAGING_REUSE",
     "EDEN_UP_SWAPCHAIN_RECREATE", "EDEN_UP_TC_BUDGET_CAP", "EDEN_UP_UBO_SNAPSHOT",
     "EDEN_UP_UPLOAD_ALL_STAGES", "EDEN_UP_WIDE_COMPUTE_SSBOS", "EDEN_UP_ZPASS_QUERY_BANKS",
